aot.ui.ctl.anchor=§lHold use§r: fire the anchors where you look (45m) and reel in while held. Anchors stick to titans and move with them. Needs the ODM gear on your legs and blades in hand.
aot.ui.ctl.release=§lRelease§r: cut the wires. Your momentum carries you in an arc for a moment.
aot.ui.ctl.boost=§lJump in the air§r: a gas burst in the direction you look (6 gas).
aot.ui.ctl.spin=§lSneak in the air§r: spinning slash. Cuts everything around you and the nape if it's in reach (5 gas).
aot.ui.ctl.nape=§lThe nape§r: the back of the neck. Strike it from behind or above to kill in one blow - but only with momentum (speed, or right after using the wires); otherwise the cut is too shallow. Everywhere else regenerates in a cloud of steam.
aot.ui.ctl.pass=§lAnchor into a titan and reel in§r: sweep past its nape at speed and you cut it automatically.
aot.ui.ctl.ankle=§lCut the ankles§r: sever the tendons and the titan drops to its knees, bringing the nape down.
aot.ui.ctl.land=§lLanding§r: a gas burst just before you hit the ground cancels fall damage (needs gear and gas).
aot.ui.ctl.blades=§lBlades§r: they chip with every cut and are swapped for a spare automatically when worn out.
aot.ui.ctl.gas=§lGas§r: spent by anchors, reeling and bursts. Drink a gas canister to refill.
aot.ui.ctl.spear=§lThunder spear§r: use to fire. It sticks and detonates after 1.2s - fatal near the nape.
aot.ui.ctl.grab=§lIf grabbed§r: slash, or sneak to cut the fingers (10 gas). You have 2.5 seconds.
aot.ui.ctl.flare=§lFlare gun§r: use to fire, sneak + use to change the colour.
aot.ui.titan.intro=Titans hunt only humans and regenerate any wound but the nape. They drop nothing and evaporate when slain.
aot.ui.titan.titan_small=§l4-meter class§r - small. Bites instead of grabbing. Easy to hamstring.
aot.ui.titan.titan_medium=§l7-meter class§r - grabs anything in reach and swats at soldiers in front of its chest.
aot.ui.titan.titan_large=§l13-meter class§r - large. The ground shakes as it walks; you need ODM to reach the nape.
aot.ui.titan.titan_abnormal=§lAbnormal§r - unpredictable. Leaps without warning and sprints flat out.
aot.ui.titan.night=At night, without sunlight, titans sit motionless - until attacked.
aot.ui.titan.regen=Regeneration starts 3 seconds after the last cut. Thunder spear wounds heal slowly.
aot.ui.corps.intro=Summon them with spawn eggs. They launch their own ODM attacks on titans they see.
aot.ui.corps.levi=§lLevi§r - humanity's strongest soldier. A double strike that almost never misses.
aot.ui.corps.mikasa=§lMikasa§r - the red scarf. Second only to Levi, with a double strike.
aot.ui.corps.eren=§lEren§r - the boy who swore to wipe out every last titan.
aot.ui.corps.armin=§lArmin§r - not much of a fighter, but his wits save his friends.
aot.ui.corps.erwin=§lErwin§r - the commander. Near a titan fight he rallies everyone around him.
aot.ui.corps.hange=§lHange§r - the titan researcher, with glasses and goggles.
aot.ui.corps.others=§lJean, Sasha and Connie§r and rank-and-file soldiers fight alongside you.
aot.ui.corps.recruit=Give them bread or a baked potato to recruit them (Sasha only takes baked potatoes). Use a recruit to make them wait.
aot.ui.set.spawns=Titans spawn naturally
aot.ui.set.grab=Titans can grab players
aot.ui.set.hud=Show gas and blades on screen
